{"id":"vol8-06","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/vol8-06/audio-3.m4a","model":"small","duration":398.27,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":3.3,"text":"Now turn to section 3 on page 5.","words":[["Now",0.0,0.26],["turn",0.26,0.54],["to",0.54,0.74],["section",0.74,0.98],["3",0.98,1.6],["on",1.6,2.2],["page",2.2,2.52],["5.",2.52,3.3]]},{"start":5.96,"end":6.64,"text":"Section 3.","words":[["Section",5.96,6.08],["3.",6.08,6.64]]},{"start":7.7,"end":13.82,"text":"You will hear two engineering students called Ray and Adele discussing an article they have","words":[["You",7.7,8.06],["will",8.06,8.24],["hear",8.24,8.46],["two",8.46,8.84],["engineering",8.84,9.36],["students",9.36,9.9],["called",9.9,10.48],["Ray",10.48,10.92],["and",10.92,11.32],["Adele",11.32,11.78],["discussing",11.78,12.66],["an",12.66,13.02],["article",13.02,13.38],["they",13.38,13.68],["have",13.68,13.82]]},{"start":13.82,"end":17.64,"text":"read about making building bricks from waste materials.","words":[["read",13.82,14.08],["about",14.08,14.72],["making",14.72,15.22],["building",15.22,15.66],["bricks",15.66,16.16],["from",16.16,16.46],["waste",16.46,16.86],["materials.",16.86,17.64]]},{"start":18.62,"end":24.64,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 21 to 26 on page 5.","words":[["First",18.62,19.34],["you",19.34,19.58],["have",19.58,19.72],["some",19.72,19.88],["time",19.88,20.28],["to",20.28,20.56],["look",20.56,20.68],["at",20.68,20.8],["questions",20.8,21.08],["21",21.08,21.98],["to",21.98,22.22],["26",22.22,22.78],["on",22.78,23.72],["page",23.72,24.02],["5.",24.02,24.64]]},{"start":70.11,"end":74.09,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 26.","words":[["Now",70.11,70.47],["listen",70.47,70.77],["carefully",70.77,71.25],["and",71.25,71.65],["answer",71.65,71.99],["questions",71.99,72.39],["21",72.39,73.27],["to",73.27,73.53],["26.",73.53,74.09]]},{"start":74.09,"end":74.23,"text":"Next.","words":[["Next.",74.09,74.23]]},{"start":77.52,"end":78.44,"text":"Hi Adele.","words":[["Hi",77.52,78.04],["Adele.",78.04,78.44]]},{"start":78.76,"end":79.44,"text":"What are you reading?","words":[["What",78.76,79.02],["are",79.02,79.08],["you",79.08,79.16],["reading?",79.16,79.44]]},{"start":79.72,"end":79.94,"text":"Oh.","words":[["Oh.",79.72,79.94]]},{"start":80.2,"end":80.66,"text":"Hi Ray.","words":[["Hi",80.2,80.48],["Ray.",80.48,80.66]]},{"start":81.3,"end":83.36,"text":"It's one of the articles on the reading list.","words":[["It's",81.3,81.62],["one",81.62,81.78],["of",81.78,81.9],["the",81.9,82.02],["articles",82.02,82.4],["on",82.4,82.6],["the",82.6,82.72],["reading",82.72,82.92],["list.",82.92,83.36]]},{"start":83.82,"end":85.58,"text":"It's about bricks made from waste.","words":[["It's",83.82,84.0],["about",84.0,84.18],["bricks",84.18,84.58],["made",84.58,84.98],["from",84.98,85.22],["waste.",85.22,85.58]]},{"start":85.96,"end":87.82,"text":"Is that the one about bitum blocks?","words":[["Is",85.96,86.14],["that",86.14,86.32],["the",86.32,86.48],["one",86.48,86.6],["about",86.6,86.98],["bitum",86.98,87.58],["blocks?",87.58,87.82]]},{"start":88.16,"end":88.4,"text":"Yes.","words":[["Yes.",88.16,88.4]]},{"start":88.7,"end":89.16,"text":"That's right.","words":[["That's",88.7,88.96],["right.",88.96,89.16]]},{"start":89.78,"end":92.96,"text":"Apparently, they're used as an alternative to concrete blocks.","words":[["Apparently,",89.78,90.3],["they're",90.58,90.9],["used",90.9,91.12],["as",91.12,91.32],["an",91.32,91.44],["alternative",91.44,91.94],["to",91.94,92.24],["concrete",92.24,92.58],["blocks.",92.58,92.96]]},{"start":93.8,"end":98.38,"text":"They combine waste ash and crushed glass with a substance called bitumen.","words":[["They",93.8,93.94],["combine",93.94,94.36],["waste",94.36,94.74],["ash",94.74,95.24],["and",95.24,95.68],["crushed",95.68,96.02],["glass",96.02,96.48],["with",96.48,96.84],["a",96.84,96.96],["substance",96.96,97.28],["called",97.28,97.68],["bitumen.",97.68,98.38]]},{"start":98.72,"end":99.1,"text":"Yeah.","words":[["Yeah.",98.72,99.1]]},{"start":99.34,"end":100.68,"text":"I read it a couple of weeks ago.","words":[["I",99.34,99.42],["read",99.42,99.62],["it",99.62,99.74],["a",99.74,99.86],["couple",99.86,100.0],["of",100.0,100.14],["weeks",100.14,100.32],["ago.",100.32,100.68]]},{"start":100.86,"end":101.54,"text":"Really interesting.","words":[["Really",100.86,101.06],["interesting.",101.06,101.54]]},{"start":102.18,"end":104.76,"text":"It's going to be really useful for our next assignment.","words":[["It's",102.18,102.44],["going",102.44,102.58],["to",102.58,102.74],["be",102.74,102.86],["really",102.86,103.16],["useful",103.16,103.62],["for",103.62,103.92],["our",103.92,104.08],["next",104.08,104.28],["assignment.",104.28,104.76]]},{"start":105.26,"end":105.62,"text":"Yes.","words":[["Yes.",105.26,105.62]]},{"start":105.62,"end":112.4,"text":"But I'm not doing that option actually my tutor asked me to do a summary of the article for next week seminar","words":[["But",105.62,106.1],["I'm",106.1,106.3],["not",106.3,106.5],["doing",106.5,106.7],["that",106.7,107.0],["option",107.0,107.36],["actually",107.36,108.44],["my",108.44,108.74],["tutor",108.74,109.0],["asked",109.0,109.44],["me",109.44,109.64],["to",109.64,109.82],["do",109.82,109.94],["a",109.94,110.08],["summary",110.08,110.42],["of",110.42,110.68],["the",110.68,110.8],["article",110.8,111.22],["for",111.22,111.44],["next",111.44,111.64],["week",111.64,111.88],["seminar",111.88,112.4]]},{"start":112.4,"end":117.7,"text":"I really enjoyed it and think I might even look into the topic for my dissertation","words":[["I",112.4,113.22],["really",113.22,113.66],["enjoyed",113.66,114.02],["it",114.02,114.34],["and",114.34,114.86],["think",114.86,115.1],["I",115.1,115.34],["might",115.34,115.54],["even",115.54,115.76],["look",115.76,116.04],["into",116.04,116.26],["the",116.26,116.44],["topic",116.44,116.8],["for",116.8,117.06],["my",117.06,117.22],["dissertation",117.22,117.7]]},{"start":118.52,"end":124.2,"text":"Before I read it. I'd been getting rather bored of all these green innovations in building","words":[["Before",118.52,119.08],["I",119.08,119.36],["read",119.36,119.58],["it.",119.58,119.84],["I'd",119.88,120.14],["been",120.14,120.24],["getting",120.24,120.5],["rather",120.5,121.08],["bored",121.08,121.62],["of",121.62,121.9],["all",121.9,122.04],["these",122.04,122.2],["green",122.2,122.68],["innovations",122.68,123.44],["in",123.44,123.82],["building",123.82,124.2]]},{"start":124.9,"end":127.3,"text":"Using all manner of waste materials","words":[["Using",124.9,125.26],["all",125.26,125.66],["manner",125.66,125.96],["of",125.96,126.2],["waste",126.2,126.56],["materials",126.56,127.3]]},{"start":127.3,"end":128.0,"text":"Yeah","words":[["Yeah",127.3,128.0]]},{"start":128.0,"end":133.84,"text":"But what's really new about this method is that they use bitumen to bind all the waste material","words":[["But",128.0,128.58],["what's",128.58,128.84],["really",128.84,129.22],["new",129.22,129.6],["about",129.6,129.94],["this",129.94,130.3],["method",130.3,130.7],["is",130.7,131.04],["that",131.04,131.18],["they",131.18,131.3],["use",131.3,131.52],["bitumen",131.52,131.96],["to",131.96,132.2],["bind",132.2,132.42],["all",132.42,132.92],["the",132.92,133.08],["waste",133.08,133.36],["material",133.36,133.84]]},{"start":133.84,"end":136.06,"text":"and there's no need for a chemical reaction.","words":[["and",133.84,134.14],["there's",134.14,134.4],["no",134.4,134.64],["need",134.64,134.94],["for",134.94,135.12],["a",135.12,135.24],["chemical",135.24,135.48],["reaction.",135.48,136.06]]},{"start":136.56,"end":140.28,"text":"It's not as simple as it sounds, of course, but it's a great idea.","words":[["It's",136.56,137.04],["not",137.04,137.18],["as",137.18,137.34],["simple",137.34,137.6],["as",137.6,137.8],["it",137.8,137.92],["sounds,",137.92,138.28],["of",138.38,138.5],["course,",138.5,138.72],["but",138.98,139.12],["it's",139.12,139.3],["a",139.3,139.4],["great",139.4,139.74],["idea.",139.74,140.28]]},{"start":140.54,"end":142.5,"text":"Yeah, and the quality is pretty good.","words":[["Yeah,",140.54,140.82],["and",141.02,141.14],["the",141.14,141.26],["quality",141.26,141.58],["is",141.58,141.82],["pretty",141.82,142.12],["good.",142.12,142.5]]},{"start":143.1,"end":145.5,"text":"Of course, I knew that because of the way they're made.","words":[["Of",143.1,143.28],["course,",143.28,143.46],["I",143.54,143.66],["knew",143.66,143.84],["that",143.84,144.02],["because",144.02,144.38],["of",144.38,144.64],["the",144.64,144.74],["way",144.74,144.92],["they're",144.92,145.14],["made.",145.14,145.5]]},{"start":145.62,"end":148.52,"text":"They're extremely stable, and the early tests indicate","words":[["They're",145.62,145.82],["extremely",145.82,146.16],["stable,",146.16,146.72],["and",146.9,147.12],["the",147.12,147.38],["early",147.38,147.7],["tests",147.7,148.0],["indicate",148.0,148.52]]},{"start":148.52,"end":151.58,"text":"that they're as good as concrete blocks in terms of their weight.","words":[["that",148.52,148.88],["they're",148.88,149.2],["as",149.2,149.28],["good",149.28,149.48],["as",149.48,149.6],["concrete",149.6,149.98],["blocks",149.98,150.42],["in",150.42,150.68],["terms",150.68,150.94],["of",150.94,151.08],["their",151.08,151.22],["weight.",151.22,151.58]]},{"start":152.14,"end":155.98,"text":"But I didn't expect them to do so well on water absorption tests.","words":[["But",152.14,152.48],["I",152.48,152.68],["didn't",152.68,152.88],["expect",152.88,153.12],["them",153.12,153.32],["to",153.32,153.42],["do",153.42,153.56],["so",153.56,153.74],["well",153.74,153.96],["on",153.96,154.22],["water",154.22,154.64],["absorption",154.64,155.3],["tests.",155.3,155.98]]},{"start":156.16,"end":156.44,"text":"Yeah.","words":[["Yeah.",156.16,156.44]]},{"start":156.96,"end":160.62,"text":"And there were some interesting points about their manufacture, weren't there?","words":[["And",156.96,157.28],["there",157.28,157.42],["were",157.42,157.52],["some",157.52,157.7],["interesting",157.7,158.22],["points",158.22,158.7],["about",158.7,158.98],["their",158.98,159.26],["manufacture,",159.26,159.84],["weren't",160.26,160.4],["there?",160.4,160.62]]},{"start":160.62,"end":166.62,"text":"Yeah, they use materials from a variety of sources, some from local factories, some from","words":[["Yeah,",160.62,161.08],["they",161.52,161.74],["use",161.74,161.98],["materials",161.98,162.54],["from",162.54,162.88],["a",162.88,163.04],["variety",163.04,163.5],["of",163.5,163.84],["sources,",163.84,164.26],["some",164.66,164.9],["from",164.9,165.1],["local",165.1,165.4],["factories,",165.4,165.96],["some",166.28,166.4],["from",166.4,166.62]]},{"start":166.62,"end":170.84,"text":"further afield, and they haven't had to develop any new methods of manufacture.","words":[["further",166.62,166.86],["afield,",166.86,167.38],["and",167.78,168.1],["they",168.1,168.22],["haven't",168.22,168.48],["had",168.48,168.66],["to",168.66,168.8],["develop",168.8,169.16],["any",169.16,169.44],["new",169.44,169.66],["methods",169.66,170.04],["of",170.04,170.26],["manufacture.",170.26,170.84]]},{"start":171.16,"end":175.62,"text":"Yeah, they essentially use existing ones, which is great, because that means they won't","words":[["Yeah,",171.16,171.4],["they",171.52,171.68],["essentially",171.68,172.12],["use",172.12,172.5],["existing",172.5,172.88],["ones,",172.88,173.22],["which",173.4,173.56],["is",173.56,173.68],["great,",173.68,174.12],["because",174.24,174.52],["that",174.52,175.14],["means",175.14,175.3],["they",175.3,175.46],["won't",175.46,175.62]]},{"start":175.62,"end":177.5,"text":"require massive amounts of new investment.","words":[["require",175.62,175.96],["massive",175.96,176.32],["amounts",176.32,176.6],["of",176.6,176.8],["new",176.8,177.0],["investment.",177.0,177.5]]},{"start":177.8,"end":178.08,"text":"Right.","words":[["Right.",177.8,178.08]]},{"start":178.92,"end":183.32,"text":"By the way, what do you think about the section in the article on the building of the","words":[["By",178.92,179.28],["the",179.28,179.42],["way,",179.42,179.7],["what",180.2,180.38],["do",180.38,180.52],["you",180.52,180.64],["think",180.64,180.78],["about",180.78,180.98],["the",180.98,181.16],["section",181.16,181.52],["in",181.52,181.74],["the",181.74,181.84],["article",181.84,182.2],["on",182.2,182.54],["the",182.54,182.68],["building",182.68,183.0],["of",183.0,183.2],["the",183.2,183.32]]},{"start":183.32,"end":184.04,"text":"new hospital?","words":[["new",183.32,183.48],["hospital?",183.48,184.04]]},{"start":184.62,"end":189.4,"text":"It really helped me understand the broad issues in the UK, that so much more material","words":[["It",184.62,184.84],["really",184.84,185.1],["helped",185.1,185.38],["me",185.38,185.54],["understand",185.54,186.02],["the",186.02,186.28],["broad",186.28,186.48],["issues",186.48,186.9],["in",186.9,187.14],["the",187.14,187.26],["UK,",187.26,187.66],["that",188.36,188.5],["so",188.5,188.66],["much",188.66,188.86],["more",188.86,189.04],["material",189.04,189.4]]},{"start":189.4,"end":194.58,"text":"is used by builders than by other industries, which means the construction industry has","words":[["is",189.4,189.6],["used",189.6,189.9],["by",189.9,190.22],["builders",190.22,190.54],["than",190.54,190.88],["by",190.88,191.1],["other",191.1,191.4],["industries,",191.4,191.9],["which",192.32,192.5],["means",192.5,192.74],["the",192.74,192.9],["construction",192.9,193.38],["industry",193.38,194.02],["has",194.02,194.58]]},{"start":194.58,"end":197.92,"text":"a big and growing responsibility to use green materials.","words":[["a",194.58,194.72],["big",194.72,194.98],["and",194.98,195.18],["growing",195.18,195.6],["responsibility",195.6,196.36],["to",196.36,196.72],["use",196.72,196.94],["green",196.94,197.24],["materials.",197.24,197.92]]},{"start":198.38,"end":198.86,"text":"Okay.","words":[["Okay.",198.38,198.86]]},{"start":199.32,"end":199.66,"text":"Yeah.","words":[["Yeah.",199.32,199.66]]},{"start":200.12,"end":205.4,"text":"I thought the reason why they included the hospital in the article was to show that there","words":[["I",200.12,200.7],["thought",200.7,200.96],["the",200.96,201.16],["reason",201.16,201.5],["why",201.5,201.82],["they",201.82,202.02],["included",202.02,202.38],["the",202.38,202.62],["hospital",202.62,203.0],["in",203.0,203.26],["the",203.26,203.38],["article",203.38,203.84],["was",203.84,204.24],["to",204.24,204.42],["show",204.42,204.74],["that",204.74,205.24],["there",205.24,205.4]]},{"start":205.4,"end":209.54,"text":"are already quite high levels of recycling going on in the building industry.","words":[["are",205.4,205.62],["already",205.62,206.16],["quite",206.16,206.54],["high",206.54,206.96],["levels",206.96,207.28],["of",207.28,207.44],["recycling",207.44,207.9],["going",207.9,208.26],["on",208.26,208.5],["in",208.5,208.64],["the",208.64,208.74],["building",208.74,209.0],["industry.",209.0,209.54]]},{"start":210.28,"end":213.92,"text":"I think it said 17 to 18% by value.","words":[["I",210.28,210.72],["think",210.72,210.88],["it",210.88,211.0],["said",211.0,211.2],["17",211.2,211.98],["to",211.98,212.44],["18",212.44,212.78],["%",212.78,213.26],["by",213.26,213.58],["value.",213.58,213.92]]},{"start":214.58,"end":218.74,"text":"I know that sounds pretty poor, but it's a good foundation to start making improvements","words":[["I",214.58,214.82],["know",214.82,214.96],["that",214.96,215.12],["sounds",215.12,215.38],["pretty",215.38,215.68],["poor,",215.68,216.08],["but",216.24,216.5],["it's",216.5,216.7],["a",216.7,216.78],["good",216.78,216.96],["foundation",216.96,217.42],["to",217.42,217.68],["start",217.68,217.92],["making",217.92,218.26],["improvements",218.26,218.74]]},{"start":218.74,"end":228.16,"text":"on. Don't you think? Maybe. Before you hear the rest of the discussion, you have some","words":[["on.",218.74,219.06],["Don't",219.32,219.5],["you",219.5,219.62],["think?",219.62,219.84],["Maybe.",220.4,220.8],["Before",225.02,225.36],["you",225.36,225.66],["hear",225.66,225.96],["the",225.96,226.16],["rest",226.16,226.42],["of",226.42,226.54],["the",226.54,226.62],["discussion,",226.62,227.06],["you",227.6,227.78],["have",227.78,227.98],["some",227.98,228.16]]},{"start":228.16,"end":256.05,"text":"time to look at questions 27 to 30 on page 6. Now listen and answer questions 27 to 30.","words":[["time",228.16,228.6],["to",228.6,228.84],["look",228.84,228.98],["at",228.98,229.1],["questions",229.1,229.4],["27",229.4,230.34],["to",230.34,230.58],["30",230.58,230.96],["on",230.96,231.64],["page",231.64,231.96],["6.",231.96,232.46],["Now",252.77,253.03],["listen",253.03,253.31],["and",253.31,253.71],["answer",253.71,254.09],["questions",254.09,254.51],["27",254.51,255.45],["to",255.45,255.71],["30.",255.71,256.05]]},{"start":260.26,"end":265.8,"text":"What did you think about the rival to bitchy blocks? Veggie blocks? Yeah, bricks made","words":[["What",260.26,260.62],["did",260.62,260.76],["you",260.76,260.9],["think",260.9,261.1],["about",261.1,261.32],["the",261.32,261.52],["rival",261.52,262.0],["to",262.0,262.28],["bitchy",262.28,262.58],["blocks?",262.58,262.8],["Veggie",263.5,263.82],["blocks?",263.82,264.06],["Yeah,",264.42,264.78],["bricks",265.12,265.4],["made",265.4,265.8]]},{"start":265.8,"end":271.14,"text":"out of waste cooking oil. Interesting. But it did say they could be quite smelly, you","words":[["out",265.8,266.02],["of",266.02,266.16],["waste",266.16,266.52],["cooking",266.52,266.92],["oil.",266.92,267.38],["Interesting.",267.64,267.96],["But",268.54,268.76],["it",268.76,268.88],["did",268.88,269.06],["say",269.06,269.42],["they",269.42,269.64],["could",269.64,269.86],["be",269.86,270.08],["quite",270.08,270.38],["smelly,",270.38,271.0],["you",271.04,271.14]]},{"start":271.14,"end":271.34,"text":"No.","words":[["No.",271.14,271.34]]},{"start":271.7,"end":275.44,"text":"Okay, that's one of the drawbacks bitchy blocks don't have.","words":[["Okay,",271.7,272.22],["that's",272.7,273.12],["one",273.12,273.28],["of",273.28,273.38],["the",273.38,273.52],["drawbacks",273.52,274.06],["bitchy",274.06,274.58],["blocks",274.58,274.74],["don't",274.74,275.22],["have.",275.22,275.44]]},{"start":276.04,"end":279.9,"text":"But the article said veggie blocks were very popular with certain architects.","words":[["But",276.04,276.28],["the",276.28,276.4],["article",276.4,276.76],["said",276.76,277.12],["veggie",277.12,277.5],["blocks",277.5,277.7],["were",277.7,277.96],["very",277.96,278.22],["popular",278.22,278.72],["with",278.72,278.98],["certain",278.98,279.28],["architects.",279.28,279.9]]},{"start":280.4,"end":281.68,"text":"I presume because of cost?","words":[["I",280.4,280.58],["presume",280.58,280.9],["because",280.9,281.24],["of",281.24,281.4],["cost?",281.4,281.68]]},{"start":282.14,"end":286.86,"text":"You'd think so, but actually veggie blocks come out at the same price and they take","words":[["You'd",282.14,282.46],["think",282.46,282.64],["so,",282.64,283.0],["but",283.32,283.56],["actually",283.56,284.06],["veggie",284.06,284.5],["blocks",284.5,284.74],["come",284.74,285.1],["out",285.1,285.32],["at",285.32,285.46],["the",285.46,285.56],["same",285.56,285.8],["price",285.8,286.16],["and",286.16,286.52],["they",286.52,286.64],["take",286.64,286.86]]},{"start":286.86,"end":287.6,"text":"longer to make.","words":[["longer",286.86,287.12],["to",287.12,287.36],["make.",287.36,287.6]]},{"start":288.32,"end":290.3,"text":"The thing is, they look prettier.","words":[["The",288.32,288.6],["thing",288.6,288.88],["is,",288.88,289.18],["they",289.38,289.54],["look",289.54,289.8],["prettier.",289.8,290.3]]},{"start":290.84,"end":291.2,"text":"No.","words":[["No.",290.84,291.2]]},{"start":292.34,"end":296.86,"text":"Bitchy blocks are dark brown, which means they normally have to be covered with a","words":[["Bitchy",292.34,292.9],["blocks",292.9,293.12],["are",293.12,293.4],["dark",293.4,293.78],["brown,",293.78,294.26],["which",294.68,294.96],["means",294.96,295.18],["they",295.18,295.38],["normally",295.38,295.68],["have",295.68,295.98],["to",295.98,296.1],["be",296.1,296.24],["covered",296.24,296.5],["with",296.5,296.7],["a",296.7,296.86]]},{"start":296.86,"end":302.24,"text":"lighter facing whereas the veggie blocks come out as a pleasant light beige so they don't","words":[["lighter",296.86,297.14],["facing",297.14,297.62],["whereas",297.62,298.5],["the",298.5,298.72],["veggie",298.72,299.04],["blocks",299.04,299.26],["come",299.26,299.66],["out",299.66,299.84],["as",299.84,299.98],["a",299.98,300.1],["pleasant",300.1,300.34],["light",300.34,300.7],["beige",300.7,301.18],["so",301.18,301.96],["they",301.96,302.08],["don't",302.08,302.24]]},{"start":302.24,"end":307.44,"text":"need covering. So there are advantages and disadvantages with","words":[["need",302.24,302.38],["covering.",302.38,302.74],["So",303.26,303.74],["there",303.74,305.18],["are",305.18,305.4],["advantages",305.4,305.92],["and",305.92,306.4],["disadvantages",306.4,306.82],["with",306.82,307.44]]},{"start":307.44,"end":311.56,"text":"both types. Yeah, so how do you think these innovations","words":[["both",307.44,307.66],["types.",307.66,308.06],["Yeah,",308.8,309.16],["so",309.64,309.94],["how",309.94,310.18],["do",310.18,310.28],["you",310.28,310.38],["think",310.38,310.62],["these",310.62,310.9],["innovations",310.9,311.56]]},{"start":311.56,"end":314.38,"text":"will change practices in the construction industry?","words":[["will",311.56,311.96],["change",311.96,312.36],["practices",312.36,312.96],["in",312.96,313.24],["the",313.24,313.36],["construction",313.36,313.84],["industry?",313.84,314.38]]},{"start":315.18,"end":319.26,"text":"Well, I think butcher blocks have the potential to make a huge difference.","words":[["Well,",315.18,315.5],["I",315.92,316.24],["think",316.24,316.46],["butcher",316.46,316.74],["blocks",316.74,317.02],["have",317.02,317.28],["the",317.28,317.42],["potential",31